        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(run-main): replace redundant dynamic import with static import of paths",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`src/cli/run-main.ts` loads `resolveGatewayPort` via `await import(../config/paths.js)` inside a `Promise.all`, even though the same module is already imported statically at the top of the file for `resolveStateDir`.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nNode.js module cache ensures a second dynamic import of an already-loaded module returns the exact same module object. Adding `resolveGatewayPort` to the existing static import removes the indirection with no behavioral change.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo user-visible impact.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `npm run typecheck` passes.",
